agiri Rao", "2017", "**Sculpture**"], ["T.H. (Tripuraneni Hanuman) Chowdary", "2017", "**Civil service** (VSNL founder CMD)"], ["Sportspersons", "2017", "8: Kohli, Sreejesh, Sakshi Malik, Dipa Karmakar, Vikas Gowda, Mariyappan, Deepa Malik, Shekar Naik"], ["Dr Subroto Das", "2018", "'**Highway Messiah**' (highway trauma care)"], ["Dronavalli Harika", "2019", "**Chess**"], ["Bipin Ganatra", "2020", "**Volunteer fire service** (Kolkata)"], ["Drona Bhuyan, Ghulam Nabi Dar, Dasari Kondappa", "2024", "Arts"], ["Rajaram Jain", "2024", "Literature and education"], ["Dukhu Majhi", "2024", "Social work"]]}, {"k": "x", "x": "Learn each awardee with the **field** of the award, not just the award."}]}
